Key documentation files for deep context:
- `ARCHITECTURE.md` — System layers, priority map, critical data flow
- `docs/coding-standards.md` — Full coding standards across all languages
- `docs/security.md` — Security model, threat model, compliance
- `docs/style-guide.md` — Output formatting, colors, naming
- `docs/priority.md` — P0-P3 priority classification
